t need one more thing. Now, have you seen the precocious cniogcrags? I would like one of them. I''ve a friend who wants it for display, why, I don''t know. He wants to hang it on his wall. As an exotic type of beast. Oh, did you get the creature? Hand it over! Ah, great! Thank you! Now, you certainly should receive a [reward] for your efforts! Here, you surely do. I hope you find it useful, <Player>! Thanks again for your help! Hopefully, this enchanted silver my, ahh, friend, is sending will make a difference here!||||Ah, you''re here to help me, are you? <Player>, you know about the [enchanted silver] in the Silvermine Mountains, in Hibernia? Aye, <Player>, it''s mainly controlled by those evil siabra local to the area, however, I''ve a friend who has managed to get a large amount of the silver. See, we''ve come up with a trade. The next boat leaves for Hibernia shortly, and I don''t have the time to go and get everything to trade myself. See, there are many things here that may be valuable back in the mainland. I''ve arranged a trade. All I need right now, though, is two sporites. <Player>, <Player>, did you get the sporites? i understand that if you dry them out, they become quite useful. <Player>, that''s what some of the Sylvan have told me! Oh, this is a good one! I need just one more from you. Do you have it? Great. Now, I just need one more thing. Now, have you seen the precocious cniogcrags? I would like one of them. I''ve a friend who wants it for display, why, I don''t know. He wants to hang it on his wall. As an exotic type of beast. Oh, did you get the creature? Hand it over! Ah, great! Thank you! Now, you certainly should receive a [reward] for your efforts! Here, you surely do. I hope you find it useful, <Player>! Thanks again for your help! Hopefully, this enchanted silver my, ahh, friend, is sending will make a difference here!','||||cq_cniogcrag_corpse',1,11,50,'0|0|0|0|1100','0|0|0|0|15928',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'cq_hib_hero_s_might','','Sylvan Sha