est craftspeople in the land worked hard to create this, <Player>, and now we present it to you. We cannot thank you enough for your service to Anniogel, <Player>. Lord Arawan and Lady Lile shall look upon you with favor for your help. Fare thee well, <Player>.','','19','DOL.GS.Quests.ClassicQuestStep','2026-10-08 06:15:00');
